=2 Walkthrough
This mission splits into two BCNM fights which you may complete in either order. You win each fight by bringing the primary target down to 10%.
* **{c=red:Note: }** Drawing your weapon will immediately start the battles below, regardless of your distance to the enemy.
* **{c=red:Note: }** If you fail either battle, you must return to {z:Leafallia} and click the **Aged Stump** at (H-8) to reacquire the Key Item required for entry.

=3 {m:Dhokmak}
* Head to (K-11) in {z:Cirdas Caverns}.
** The quickest way is {p:Waypoint} > {z:Yorcia Weald}'s **Frontier Station** > Head west into tunnel to {z:Cirdas Caverns} and walk. (Requires {k:Watercraft} and {k:Climbing}.)
** Another route is using the {p:Waypoint} > {p:Enigmatic Device} > {z:Cirdas Caverns}.
** One more route, cheap & fast: Homepoint to {z:Ceizak Battlegrounds} > mount to nearby **#2** in order to waypoint to **#3** for just 2 units > west to E-10 entrance of {z:Sih Gates} -> go west to C/D-5 entrance to {z:Cirdas Caverns} -> southeast entrance of {z:Cirdas Caverns} (L-13) -> (K-11) in {z:Cirdas Caverns}

* Examine the **Wavering Flux** for a short cutscene.
* Examine it again to be transported to {z:Cirdas Caverns (U)}.
** The party will be warped in regardless of their location in the zone.
* You will fight {m:Dhokmak} and 3 {m:Malignant Acuex}.
** {p:Darrcuiln} will assist you. The battle will end in a loss if Darrcuiln is defeated.
** Although the Acuex minions can be slept, they will more than likely be woken up by Darrcuiln due to his frontal cleave attacks.
** {m:Dhokmak} has roughly 100k HP and **will be defeated when his HP is taken below 10%**.
* Upon defeating {m:Dhokmak}, you will receive {@k} {k:Dhokmak's blood sigil} and the title "__Vanquisher of Dhokmak__".

=3 {m:Ashrakk}
* Head to the southeastern section of (H-6) in {z:Yorcia Weald} (near the Colonization Rieve.)
** The quickest way there is to use the {p:Waypoint} > {z:Yorcia Weald} > **Frontier Bivouac #1** and then head for the southeastern section of (H-6).
* Examine the **Wavering Flux** for a short cutscene.
* Examine it again to be transported to {z:Yorcia Weald (U)}.
* You will fight {m:Ashrakk}.
** He will summon a {m:Hell-spawned Orthrus} under 50%. The Orthrus itself has moderately high health for a minion.
*** You can kill {m:Ashrakk} and ignore the minion if your dps is high enough.
** **Morimar** will assist you. The battle will end in a loss if Morimar is defeated.
** {m:Ashrakk} has roughly 100k HP and will be defeated when his HP is taken below 10%.
** He has 3 types of melee attacks: single-target 3-hit, frontal cleave with added effect {s:Shock}, and single-target knockback(?).
* Upon defeating {m:Ashrakk}, you will receive {@k} {k:Ashrakk's blood sigil} and the title "__Vanquisher of Ashrakk__".

=3 Notes
* Repeating these battles to assist someone else yields 20,000 {p:Bayld} per fight.

